    <h1>The "Cash-Back" Health Plan Nobody Explains Right</h1>
    <p class="byline">By <strong>Thomas Crowhurst</strong> &middot; 5 min read</p>
    <p class="dek">You've probably seen a plan that pays YOU money every time you go to the doctor. Here's what it actually does, what it doesn't, and how it fits next to real insurance &mdash; no sales pitch, just the facts.</p>
  </div>
